# 📋 CodeArena Project Scratchpad & Feature Roadmap

## 🎯 High-Level Vision
CodeArena is an all-in-one competitive programming tournament, social network, and skill acceleration platform for developers. It bridges competitive coding platforms with real-time gamified tournaments, 1v1 duels, social circles, and AI-powered catch-up coaching.

---

## 🚀 Status & Roadmap

### ✅ Phase 1: Core Tournament & LeetCode Battling Engine [COMPLETED]
- [x] **Authentication & Identity**: Secure JWT + bcrypt authentication with unique LeetCode ID linkage, avatar fetching, and cloud profile persistence.
- [x] **Tournament & Event Modes**:
  - 🏆 **Standard Challenge**: Multi-player group events (1-14 days) with dynamic rankings.
  - ⚔️ **1v1 Duel Mode**: Fast-paced 24-hour head-to-head battle capped strictly at 2 competitors.
  - 🎯 **Topic Sprint**: DSA-focused challenges (DP, Trees/Graphs, Arrays/Strings, SQL).
- [x] **Live LeetCode Sync**: Official GraphQL integration polling live solve stats (Easy, Medium, Hard deltas).
- [x] **Scoring Engine**: Difficulty-weighted point system (Easy +10 XP, Medium +20 XP, Hard +40 XP).
- [x] **Gamified Tier Progression**: 5 tiers (Novice Coder ➔ Code Warrior ➔ Algo Master ➔ Elite Architect ➔ Grandmaster) with dynamic XP badges and animated progress bars.
- [x] **Activity Stream & Notifications**: Live solve alerts, tournament events, Expo push token integration.
- [x] **Cloud Migration**: Upgraded SQLite database to Supabase PostgreSQL with RLS, cascade constraints, and Render backend hosting (`https://app-blw0.onrender.com`).

